    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Have fun on minimalist-style circuits, and don't forget to stay on screen for a chance to win.<br />\r\nIf you go off-screen, avenge your death with a secondary weapon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features radio-controlled cars and boats on a miniature scale, so watch out for small parts that can be ingested!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n- 13 unique environments (miniature circuit, office, beach, pond...)<br />\r\n- 20 drivers to find your style<br />\r\n- 27 body styles to choose from (20 cars and 7 boats)<br />\r\n- 7 collectable weapons for use against opponents<br />\r\n- 3 secondary weapons for revenge (fly swatter, missile...)<br />\r\n- Physical objects, bonuses and other interactions (turbo, oil puddle, frogs...)<br />\r\n- A life bar that recharges with each new round<br />\r\n- A tutorial to learn the basics of driving (1 player)<br />\r\n- Career mode to unlock new content (1 to 4 local players)<br />\r\n- Fast race mode for fun at will (1 to 4 players local)<br />\r\n- 3 game modes, 3 difficulty levels and 2 driving styles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls supported:<br />\r\n- Player 1 can play with keyboard or joystick<br />\r\n- Other players can play with joystick<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Support for ultra-wide 21:9 screens",
    "about_the_game": "Have fun on minimalist-style circuits, and don't forget to stay on screen for a chance to win.<br />\r\nIf you go off-screen, avenge your death with a secondary weapon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features radio-controlled cars and boats on a miniature scale, so watch out for small parts that can be ingested!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n- 13 unique environments (miniature circuit, office, beach, pond...)<br />\r\n- 20 drivers to find your style<br />\r\n- 27 body styles to choose from (20 cars and 7 boats)<br />\r\n- 7 collectable weapons for use against opponents<br />\r\n- 3 secondary weapons for revenge (fly swatter, missile...)<br />\r\n- Physical objects, bonuses and other interactions (turbo, oil puddle, frogs...)<br />\r\n- A life bar that recharges with each new round<br />\r\n- A tutorial to learn the basics of driving (1 player)<br />\r\n- Career mode to unlock new content (1 to 4 local players)<br />\r\n- Fast race mode for fun at will (1 to 4 players local)<br />\r\n- 3 game modes, 3 difficulty levels and 2 driving styles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls supported:<br />\r\n- Player 1 can play with keyboard or joystick<br />\r\n- Other players can play with joystick<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Support for ultra-wide 21:9 screens",
